      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{61de6284f2f6660c2a4bba7a|full_name}: The difficulty is that post process is allowed on PC, but not on Quest, so the SDK cannot simply remove the related components as it will directly affect the scene for every platform. \n\nThat said, they can potentially remove the post process layer during build time and include the post process stack in vrc client itself (which I think they actually do?) so all they need to grab at build time is our post process volumes and profiles. This way, all the prerequisites are not duplicated and also not included in Quest build and it should work the same in theory.\n\nThis is just a guess, maybe this solution would break stuff and there is maybe a better solution I didn't think yet.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
